      "ForgetProposalView": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "What would go, before anything goes.\n\n``status`` distinguishes three answers a client must handle differently:\n``preview`` (here is what I found), ``not_found`` (nothing matched those\nwords), ``too_broad`` (too much matched to show, so nothing is offered).\nCollapsing the last two into an empty list would leave a person unable to\ntell \"you never told me that\" from \"say which one\".",
        "properties": {
          "action": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "maxLength": 16,
                "type": "string"
